      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FROM TIGERLAND (7) did a good job to finish second two starts ago then registered a commanding victory last time out, scoring by 15 metres over 2100m at Bunbury. Will need a bit of luck negotiating a very wide starting position. This looks a sterner test than last time but he is capable of making it consecutive wins. DEL BOCAVISTA BAY (8) was responsible for a far better performance last time out, finishing fifth over 1684m at this track. Can travel in a nice spot from this draw and wait on the sprint lane if necessary. Leading hope in a similar race. LEAVEAMESSAGE (9) is heading the right way, improving last time out to finish third at Gloucester Park over 1730m. Genuine threat. TURBO JAY (12) was in the money two starts ago then things went amiss last start when he broke and finished eighth over 2130m at Gloucester Park. No favours expected from this draw. Finds a nice race and can make up for that last start mishap.",
